{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:9404c13d56f3579d","name":"Aurial Blaster","source":{"id":"source:reference-9404c13d56f3579d","title":"Aurial Blaster","revision":16032,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:53:32Z","sha256":"bf9649e0d2abe900cc795c0c4e3ceb0aa4dfddf91656122f22b10d61ec7e1762","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16032","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Aurial%20Blaster&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-9404c13d56f3579d","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Designed by a weapons manufacturer called Systech, this weapon is awkward and difficult to wield without special training. Shaped like a pistol with auxiliary sonic emitters attached to either side of the barrel, the Aurial Blaster can deafen a target with a successful hit.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When a target is struck by an Aurial Blaster, if the attack roll equals or exceeds the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},", the target takes a -5 penalty on all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," checks made until the end of the attacker's next turn. An Aurial Blaster is treated as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistol"}," for the purpose of determining ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},". An Aurial Blaster requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"},". After 50 shots, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," must be replaced.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapons (Ranged)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapons_(Ranged)","referenceId":"reference:c954289d43de9110"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Medium\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 2,500\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 3d6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," NO\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 1 Kilogram\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy (",{"tag":"a","children":["Sonic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sonic"},")\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
